    "Openings: north the hall's own section, onto the Rec Area's 2.4 x 2.8 south mouth; east the branch, 2.4 x 3.0, leaving at 45 degrees and cutting the east wall on the slant from z -2.90 to 0.50 (bearings 22.5 to 112.5), its taller ceiling stepping over the 2.8 m opening; south the Courtyard's ancient 2.2 x 2.7 opening, 0.7 m deep, the floor running on through it.",
    "Seen through them: north, the Rec Area's west half -- the west game table and chairs, the end of the shelf, the tape cabinet, the north wall (the Conference door out of sight); north-east, up the branch, the Rec Corridor's north wall 24 to 27 m off, and a sliver of Dorm B's first east bunk through its portal; south, the Courtyard in daylight -- the platform, the stair's cut in the parapet, the parapet and the sea just below the horizon over it (the Courtyard's own scene, registered)."
